WEBVTT

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.480
Huh?

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.250
Is that a guest?

00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:11.740
I'm sorry! We aren't open yet.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:13.990
Mom?

00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:20.010
Hello.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.170
I'm Miyazawa Fuuka's mother.

00:01:53.730 --> 00:01:56.220
Thank you for taking care of my daughter.

00:01:56.220 --> 00:01:58.470
It isn't much, but this
is a token of my gratitude.

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:02.060
Thank you for being so courteous.

00:02:02.060 --> 00:02:04.970
Please, have a seat.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.590
Thank you.

00:02:06.590 --> 00:02:07.980
Pardon me.

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:11.180
All the way from Iwate, huh?

00:02:11.180 --> 00:02:12.440
Oh, want some?

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:13.880
Shochu-infused ice pops.

00:02:13.880 --> 00:02:16.240
No thanks. I appreciate it, though.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:19.440
I'm embarrassed to admit

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:24.170
I didn't know Fuuka was here 
until just the other day.

00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:29.370
Thank you very much for allowing 
a stranger like her into your home.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.430
Not at all.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:34.320
Fuuka-san's been a great
help to our aquarium.

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:37.130
She'd practically run away from home.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:39.300
We were worried.

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:45.600
She finally let me know where she is, 
so I came to here introduce myself.

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:48.100
I'm taking her home.

00:02:54.230 --> 00:02:56.110
Why would she come?

00:02:56.110 --> 00:02:58.910
Well, of course your mom's worried.

00:02:58.910 --> 00:03:01.050
I get that...

00:03:01.050 --> 00:03:03.590
But I have my circumstances, too.

00:03:03.590 --> 00:03:04.370
Huh?

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:10.000
It doesn't look too well.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:10.620
Fuuka!

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:14.630
Your mom's saying she's taking you home.

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.540
Come over here!

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:23.390
Do you want to go home?

00:03:24.290 --> 00:03:26.010
Not yet.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.700
I do plan on going home someday, though.

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:29.640
All right.

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.310
Run while you can.

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:33.400
I'll take care of your stuff.

00:03:33.400 --> 00:03:35.080
R-Run?!

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:37.130
Right, you can always do that!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:38.520
Good idea, Kukuru!

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.070
I'll stall your mom.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:43.070
Get as far as you can in the meantime.

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:45.040
It's like a movie!

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.330
Awesome!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.330
B-But...

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:48.830
Is this really what you want?

00:03:48.830 --> 00:03:50.380
You don't want to go home yet, do you?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:53.210
Now's your only chance to run.

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:54.670
Get ready!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.620
Quick!

00:04:07.360 --> 00:04:09.360
It was brief, but I had fun.

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:10.270
Same.

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.350
Thank you for everything.

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:13.820
We've got it from here.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.230
Good luck.

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:21.800
Now, then...

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.090
Where do I go?

00:04:27.430 --> 00:04:29.740
There they are.

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:31.920
Huh? Where's Fuuka-chan?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:34.120
Oh, uh...

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.600
Fuuka's out right now.

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:38.620
She's prepping for the touch pool.

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:40.000
She'll be right back.

00:04:40.680 --> 00:04:42.170
I see.

00:04:43.480 --> 00:04:48.540
Would you like to take a look 
at the marine life in the meantime?

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:50.410
No, before that...

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:55.390
Would it be all right if I visited your home 
to greet your wife as well?

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.940
I'd like to thank her 
for letting Fuuka stay.

00:04:58.940 --> 00:05:00.650
Sure thing.

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:03.470
Gramps, can I go with you?

00:05:03.470 --> 00:05:05.900
I'll have Umi-yan and Kuuya-san 
take care of the aquarium.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:07.290
I'll come right back.

00:05:07.290 --> 00:05:08.860
All right.

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:10.530
This is my granddaughter.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:15.260
I'm acting director Misakino Kukuru.

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.920
Nice to meet you.

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:20.790
I'll bring the car around.

00:05:33.620 --> 00:05:38.310
<i>This feels... familiar.</i>

00:05:39.690 --> 00:05:42.140
<i>It's like the time I first came here.</i>

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:46.540
<i>I guess I'm right back where I started?</i>

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.120
<b>Bus Schedule</b>

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.120
<b>Chinen Marine Leisure Center</b>

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:52.940
It's going to be a while.

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:02.650
Hello?

00:06:02.650 --> 00:06:03.820
<i>Where are you?</i>

00:06:03.820 --> 00:06:05.280
The bus stop up the hill.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:05.980
<i>No!</i>

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:08.170
<i>Your mom's driving that way.</i>

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.450
<i>Run, quick!</i>

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:12.600
Run? But...

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:41.580
<b>Kamee Diner</b>

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:42.080
My, my.

00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:44.710
Thank you for coming from so far. Welcome.

00:06:44.710 --> 00:06:48.720
I would have prepared more 
if you'd have let me know.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.840
This is more than enough, ma'am.

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:53.450
I'm just here to say "thank you."

00:06:53.910 --> 00:06:56.180
She brought us a gift.

00:06:56.870 --> 00:06:58.560
Please have some red-bean jelly treats.

00:06:58.560 --> 00:07:01.160
And these are Okinawan doughnuts.

00:07:01.160 --> 00:07:03.390
Fuuka-chan loves them, too.

00:07:04.760 --> 00:07:06.330
This is boiled pig leg.

00:07:06.330 --> 00:07:09.640
It's been braising overnight, 
so it should be tasty.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.070
Just a little, then.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.440
Wow, you're right.

00:07:16.440 --> 00:07:18.330
It's so flavorful.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:20.920
Have some of this, too.

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.090
What's this?

00:07:22.090 --> 00:07:23.950
Grams' homemade plum wine.

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:26.090
It pairs great with the food.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.310
But...

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.290
Please, dig in.

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.190
I know people from Tohoku love their sake.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:33.500
Yes, well...

00:07:33.500 --> 00:07:35.070
Just a little, then.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:42.440
My... My, my...

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.490
Take your time.

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.440
<b>Closed</b>

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:48.440
Are you serious?!

00:07:48.750 --> 00:07:49.940
That's so fun!

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:51.710
It's not fun.

00:07:51.710 --> 00:07:53.340
Sorry.

00:07:53.340 --> 00:07:55.400
I'm just so bored every day.

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:58.400
I can't help but get excited 
about fights and arguments and stuff.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.980
So, what should I do?

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:02.910
You came here because
you wanted my help, didn't you?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:04.580
I'm getting pumped!

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:09.390
Um, to be honest, 
I have no idea where to go.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:12.220
Oh, don't worry. 
I've got you covered.

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:15.390
My mom's good at this kind of stuff.

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:17.760
Like, running away 
and life problems and stuff.

00:08:17.760 --> 00:08:18.900
Is that what you need?

00:08:19.430 --> 00:08:21.080
How far do you want to run?

00:08:21.080 --> 00:08:21.930
What's your plan?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:23.190
Do you have money?

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:26.440
U-Um...

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.010
Nothing coming to mind?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.350
It was so sudden.

00:08:30.350 --> 00:08:32.320
Yeah, I bet.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.320
Well, it's a bit early, 
but how about lunch?

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.410
I'll cook some leftovers.

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.610
Let's eat together.

00:08:37.610 --> 00:08:39.450
I'll help.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.450
Nah, just stay put.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.410
I'm not serving anything fancy.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:08:57.320
You're amazing, Udon-chan.

00:08:57.320 --> 00:08:58.200
I know.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.180
I'm used to it.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.840
I've been helping at the shop 
since I was little.

00:09:01.840 --> 00:09:04.340
This is business as usual for me.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:06.690
Just like Kukuru.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:12.940
I cook, I serve the customers, 
I clean up, and I do it all over again.

00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:20.410
Though unlike her, I don't have 
any awesome dreams that I can brag about.

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:24.370
I like this job, though.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:29.500
I don't mind having a lot to do, too.

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:30.750
Right?

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.120
When you're busy, you don't have time 
to worry about things that don't matter.

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:36.960
Here you are.

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:39.510
Kamee Leftover Udon Champuru!

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:41.850
Okay, let's eat.

00:09:43.490 --> 00:09:45.180
Time to eat.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:52.820
It's good.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.120
Right?

00:09:56.560 --> 00:09:59.520
Sorry, I overslept.

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:02.580
I was drinking with Umi-yan all night.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:05.040
Hey!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:07.160
I've met you before.

00:10:12.880 --> 00:10:14.200
Akisamiyo!

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.200
Fate's brought us back together!

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.630
I told you you'd have a good
encounter with someone!

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.840
My fortune-telling is super accurate!

00:10:22.550 --> 00:10:26.060
<b>Mother Arrives</b>

00:10:22.840 --> 00:10:24.900
I-I can't breathe.

00:10:29.030 --> 00:10:29.940
Kai!

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:31.690
Hey, how'd it go?

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.050
Grams' plum wine.

00:10:35.050 --> 00:10:37.080
Nice, the ultimate weapon.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:39.480
Grams' plum wine is the forbidden wine.

00:10:39.480 --> 00:10:43.450
She's got a good buzz going, so we asked her 
to stay at our place for a while.

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.830
Good going.

00:10:44.830 --> 00:10:45.680
Yeah.

00:10:45.680 --> 00:10:47.470
'Sup.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:49.580
Kuuya-san, do you have a moment?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:50.440
What?

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:51.960
Well...

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.490
Oh, seriously?

00:10:58.490 --> 00:11:00.050
So she's not coming back anymore?

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.050
What are you going to do 
about the touch pool?

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.910
We're short-staffed again.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:05.870
Well...

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.390
I'll figure it out.

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:12.300
I thought things would be easier.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:14.510
I shouldn't have gotten my hopes up.

00:11:14.510 --> 00:11:16.620
He's right, though. Who's going to be

00:11:16.620 --> 00:11:19.070
the attendant for the touch pools 
if Miyazawa-san isn't?

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.980
She had a good thing going, too.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.450
Let's get back to work for now.

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:27.960
Yo, Kukuru.

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.190
Wait...

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:08.680
I'm sorry. I had too much to drink.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.350
Not at all.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:13.360
You should stay over tonight, too.

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:15.250
No, no, I couldn't do that.

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:19.240
I can see why Fuuka wanted
to stay here so much.

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:22.880
But I can't allow her to impose any more.

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.370
That's not it.

00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.730
Fuuka-chan didn't say 
she wanted to stay here.

00:12:28.730 --> 00:12:30.520
It's Gama Gama Aquarium.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:36.220
She asked Kukuru 
if she'd let her stay at Gama Gama.

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:40.540
That's why she's living here 
and working at the aquarium.

00:12:41.530 --> 00:12:44.890
I wonder what could have
possibly interested her?

00:12:44.890 --> 00:12:48.320
It's such a tiny aquarium.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:51.850
Did that girl ever have an interest 
in aquariums?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:55.000
I know!

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:56.290
<b>Kamee Diner</b>

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.880
Okay, talk to you soon.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.120
Bye.

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:02.680
My sister runs a beauty shop in Naha.

00:13:02.680 --> 00:13:06.120
There's a room for employees
there that you can use.

00:13:06.690 --> 00:13:08.180
Thank you!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:12.310
But you should call your mom 
once you're settled in.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.320
Okay.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:14.680
All right.

00:13:14.680 --> 00:13:16.840
I'll give you a ride there.

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.310
Give me a second.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:20.220
Good for you, Fuuka-chan.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.980
My aunt in Naha's nice.

00:13:21.980 --> 00:13:23.720
I'm relieved, too.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.820
Is it all right, though?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.160
Sure it is.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:30.480
My friend always runs away 
from home and stays there.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:33.450
Sorry, I have to tend to the shop, 
so I can't go with you.

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.520
Nah.

00:13:34.520 --> 00:13:35.580
Thanks.

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:41.240
Thanks for driving me.

00:13:41.240 --> 00:13:42.710
Sure.

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:50.200
Sorry, could you give me a moment?

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:03.960
Hey, newbie!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:06.940
Hello!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:09.680
I must have met you at the aquarium, right?

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:11.280
Bingo.

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:12.680
What are you up to?

00:14:12.680 --> 00:14:13.740
This.

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.150
This one's a blue sea star.

00:14:17.150 --> 00:14:19.040
And this is a red-eyed rock crab.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:21.230
We found a cushion star, too.

00:14:21.230 --> 00:14:22.170
Wow!

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:25.980
You remembered what I told you 
at the touch pool.

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.010
Yup.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.210
What happened to the touch pool? 
Are you on break?

00:14:29.210 --> 00:14:29.720
Eh?

00:14:29.720 --> 00:14:31.790
Yeah, I guess.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.020
More like...

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:38.170
Hey, hey, I want to touch 
some other creatures next time!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.550
Could you put in something new?

00:14:39.550 --> 00:14:41.180
Kukuru's so stingy.

00:14:41.180 --> 00:14:44.430
We've been asking forever, 
but she won't put any sharks in the tank.

00:14:44.430 --> 00:14:44.990
Right?

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:45.400
Yeah.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.820
Add some whale sharks, too!

00:14:47.410 --> 00:14:48.430
Okay.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.910
I'll tell Kukuru.

00:14:49.910 --> 00:14:51.580
Yay!

00:14:51.580 --> 00:14:55.580
Watch out for stonefish 
and blue-ringed octopuses!

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:56.840
I know.

00:14:56.840 --> 00:14:58.010
Got it.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:14:59.370
Okay.

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:10.470
We'll be in Naha in about an hour.

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.470
<b>We brought your mom 
something to eat.</b>

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.470
<b>She's buzzed from Grams' plum wine. 
I think she'll be okay for a while, 
so I'm heading back to Gama Gama.</b>

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.470
<b>Let me know if anything changes!</b>

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:15.180
<i>I'm going to Naha, where Udon-chan's
aunt is going to help me out.</i>

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.080
<i>Also, I have some business news.</i>

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:22.620
<i>Some of the kids who came to the pool 
want something new in the touch pools.</i>

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:45.250
<i>The coral blenny...</i>

00:15:47.480 --> 00:15:50.430
I still had important work to do.

00:15:51.090 --> 00:15:53.010
Please, take me back!

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:21.930
Thank you!

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:37.000
Fuuka?

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:39.340
Sorry, I...

00:16:39.340 --> 00:16:40.890
Did you forget something?

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:42.860
The coral blenny...

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:45.130
I forgot to tell you it's not doing well!

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:55.290
It sucks, but it's part of the job.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:17:00.440
When we lose a fish, we find out what killed it, 
so we can try to use the knowledge later.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:05.280
If it had a contagious disease, 
it can affect the other fish in the tank.

00:17:05.280 --> 00:17:08.310
But this one's small, so we won't do that.

00:17:09.430 --> 00:17:11.420
Hey, Kukuru...

00:17:11.420 --> 00:17:14.570
Can I be the one to send it off?

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:21.090
The first time I saw it, 
it reminded me of myself.

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:25.400
It's hidden in the corner, 
behind a lot of pretty fish.

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:30.670
I'm sorry for intruding 
for such a long time.

00:17:30.670 --> 00:17:31.980
Not at all.

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:36.400
May I look around the aquarium?

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.990
Of course.

00:17:37.990 --> 00:17:39.990
<b>Welcome to Gama Gama Aquarium</b>

00:17:41.990 --> 00:17:43.830
I'm drowning!

00:17:52.000 --> 00:17:54.010
<b>Welcome to Gama Gama</b>

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
<b><i>Naso vlamingii</i></b>

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
<b><i>Epinephelus merra</i> Bloch</b>

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
<b><i>Diodon holacanthus</i></b>

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
<b><i>Gymnothorax isingteena</i></b>

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.880
<b><i>Heniochus acuminatus</i></b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Red-eyed rock crab</b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Cushion star</b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Horned sea star</b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Sand dollar</b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Black sea cucumber</b>

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:03.140
<b>Spider conch</b>

00:18:14.320 --> 00:18:17.520
If it died of disease, 
it could spread pathogens,

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.600
so we don't cremate it 
or bury it in the water.

00:18:19.600 --> 00:18:24.010
We send it off to a
specialized processing plant.

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:25.790
It's painful.

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:45.210
Fuuka.

00:18:46.680 --> 00:18:48.140
Mom.

00:18:52.720 --> 00:18:55.140
Why an aquarium?

00:18:56.880 --> 00:18:58.190
I don't know.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:03.130
Couldn't you come home 
to Iwate and rest for a while?

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.310
I don't know.

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:10.330
But staying busy keeps me 
from thinking about stuff.

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:15.500
Um, Ma'am...

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:19.130
Fuuka-san's really hard-working 
and diligent.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:21.740
She's a really good attendant 
at the touch pools, too.

00:19:21.740 --> 00:19:25.660
She's someone we absolutely need 
at the aquarium.

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:26.430
So...!

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:27.310
Kukuru...

00:19:31.680 --> 00:19:34.280
Mom, I want to stay here.

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.500
I want to help 
with Kukuru's dream for now.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:55.210
Fine.

00:19:57.970 --> 00:19:59.710
Only for the summer.

00:19:59.710 --> 00:20:03.660
Come home in time for the
new school term in September.

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:05.300
Okay.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:11.310
That's right.

00:20:11.630 --> 00:20:12.750
I'm sorry.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:15.130
Please tell your aunt in Naha 
that I'm sorry, too.

00:20:15.590 --> 00:20:20.320
That girl left home early 
to become an idol.

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:24.190
I've never had a chance 
to be a mother to her.

00:20:24.190 --> 00:20:26.070
She's finally coming home.

00:20:26.070 --> 00:20:28.460
I could be with her.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.080
Or so I thought.

00:20:30.440 --> 00:20:33.420
Letting your child go 
is part of your job as a parent.

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:35.080
There's nothing to worry about.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:39.290
As long as she's well, 
you can see her whenever you like.

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:46.010
Please take good care of Fuuka.

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:54.680
Mom.

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:59.140
Sorry I can't go home with you.

00:21:00.170 --> 00:21:01.960
You don't have to apologize.

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:05.000
You just need some time, right?

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:09.280
You've been working so hard 
all these years by yourself.

00:21:13.220 --> 00:21:17.290
Those red boots looked pretty good on you.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:24.280
Thanks, Mom.

00:23:10.190 --> 00:23:12.070
See you!

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:17.550
Now that you're staying, 
we gotta get back in gear.

00:23:17.550 --> 00:23:19.150
Operation Summer Break.

00:23:19.150 --> 00:23:19.870
Yeah.

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:22.880
But we have only August.

00:23:23.160 --> 00:23:25.660
Let's focus on what's ahead for now.

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:27.550
Don't worry about other stuff.

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.550
Well said.

00:23:30.000 --> 00:23:32.620
Actually, Udon-chan said it first.
